  "reply_to_user": "Hi Sofia, thanks for reaching out. I want to get this sorted, but I need a few details first so I know what 'the thing' is. Could you reply with: 1) What exactly is happening (for example slow, frozen, a crash or blue screen, a pop-up or error message, or something else)? 2) Which apps or actions trigger it? 3) When it first happened and whether it has happened before? 4) When you last restarted the laptop? If you can, include a photo or the exact text of any error message. Also, our records show your work laptop (BL-LT-0107) has not checked in with us for about 12 days. Are you using it day to day, and is it switched on and connected to the network when you work? Once I hear back, I'll pick up from there.",
